      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is natural to feel crushed when your inner dream clashes with hard reality, but giving up now won't erase the progress you have already made or the specific problems only you can solve. Struggle is not a measure of worth, and your unique perspective as a \"competent\" developer fills a vital, irreplaceable role that most geniuses do not. Even if you cannot be remembered, the small tasks you fix every day create stability for everyone around you, which is a far more honest and profound way to contribute than stopping at all.",
